{
  "info": {
    "name": "User Auth API",
    "description": "Complete collection for testing the authentication system.\n\n## Architecture\n- **L1 Gateway** (port 8080) — auth proxy + admin endpoints\n- **L2 Auth Service** (port 8081) — internal auth, token issuance, client management\n- **L1 Shipment Service** (port 8082) — standalone microservice with local JWT validation\n\nBusiness APIs (shipment, tracking, invoice, status) are served by separate microservices, not proxied through L1/L2.\n\n## Folders\n- **Authentication** — token issuance, refresh, logout\n- **User Onboarding** — client registration, scope assignment, secret rotation\n- **L1 Shipment Service** — shipment with local JWT validation\n- **L2 Internal** — direct L2 access for debugging\n- **Error Scenarios** — missing/invalid token, wrong credentials\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. The `baseUrl` variable defaults to `http://localhost:8080`\n3. Use **Get Access Token** first, then run protected endpoints\n4. The `accessToken` variable is auto-saved via the Tests script",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "user-auth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shipmentUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "l2Url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clientId",
      "value": "external_partner_001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clientSecret",
      "value": "secret123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "awb",
      "value": "AWB12345",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shipmentId",
      "value": "SHP-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "invoiceId",
      "value": "INV-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "newClientId",
      "value": "partner_acme_corp",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "newClientSecret",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Token issuance, refresh, and revocation endpoints.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken?.substring(0, 50) + '...');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Obtain a JWT access token using client credentials grant.\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `accessToken` — RS256-signed JWT (15 min expiry)\n- `refreshToken` — opaque token for renewing (7 day expiry)\n- `scope` — space-separated list of granted scopes"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a new access + refresh token pair.\n\nThe old refresh token is invalidated (rotation)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke the current access token. Token is added to a Redis revocation set."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User Onboarding",
      "description": "Admin endpoints for registering new clients, assigning scopes, and managing client lifecycle.\n\n**Onboarding workflow:**\n1. Generate a secure client secret (see Generate Secret helper)\n2. Register the client via **Register Client**\n3. Assign scopes via **Assign Scopes**\n4. Provide the `clientId` and plaintext secret to the partner",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generate Client Secret (helper)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://www.random.org/strings/?num=1&len=48&digits=on&upperalpha=on&loweralpha=on&unique=on&format=plain",
              "host": ["https://www.random.org"],
              "path": ["strings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "num", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "len", "value": "48" },
                { "key": "digits", "value": "on" },
                { "key": "upperalpha", "value": "on" },
                { "key": "loweralpha", "value": "on" },
                { "key": "unique", "value": "on" },
                { "key": "format", "value": "plain" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Generate a cryptographically random 48-char secret.\n\n**Manual alternative (CLI):**\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import secrets, base64; print(base64.urlsafe_b64encode(secrets.token_bytes(48)).rstrip(b'=').decode())\"\n```\n\nAfter generating, set `newClientSecret` collection variable before registering."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Client",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  console.log('Client registered:', jsonData.clientId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"clientId\": \"{{newClientId}}\",\n    \"clientName\": \"Acme Corporation\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{newClientSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new API client.\n\nThe secret is hashed server-side (SHA-256 + salt) before storage.\nThe plaintext secret must be shared with the partner securely.\n\n**Note:** Set `newClientSecret` variable first using Generate Secret helper."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Scopes to Client",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"scopes\": [\n        \"tracking:read\",\n        \"shipment:create\"\n    ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}/scopes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}", "scopes"]
            },
            "description": "Assign one or more scopes to a client.\n\n**Available scopes:** `tracking:read`, `shipment:create`, `shipment:update`, `status:update`, `invoice:read`\n\nSee **List Available Scopes** for the full list."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Available Scopes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/scopes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "scopes"]
            },
            "description": "List all registered scopes and their descriptions."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Unlock Client",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}/unlock",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}", "unlock"]
            },
            "description": "Unlock a client that was auto-locked after 5 failed auth attempts.\n\nResets the failure counter and sets status back to `ACTIVE`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Clients",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients"]
            },
            "description": "List all registered clients."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Client Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get details for a specific client."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Client Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"status\": \"SUSPENDED\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Change client status.\n\n**Valid values:** `ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`, `SUSPENDED`, `LOCKED`, `DELETED`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke All Tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}/revoke-tokens",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}", "revoke-tokens"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke all active tokens for a client. Use in case of compromise.\n\nIterates through Redis sessions and marks every JTI as revoked."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rotate Client Secret",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"newSecret\": \"REPLACE_WITH_NEW_SECRET\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/{{newClientId}}/rotate-secret",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "clients", "{{newClientId}}", "rotate-secret"]
            },
            "description": "Rotate the client secret. The new secret is hashed server-side before storage.\n\n**Important:** Share the new plaintext secret with the partner out-of-band."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Scope",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"scopeName\": \"billing:read\",\n    \"description\": \"View billing information\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/scopes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "scopes"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new permission scope."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "L1 Shipment Service (Local JWT Validation)",
      "description": "Standalone shipment microservice that validates the JWT itself (signature + expiry) and checks revocation via L2.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Shipment (Local Validation)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"origin\": \"Port of Shanghai\",\n    \"destination\": \"Port of Los Angeles\",\n    \"description\": \"Container shipment — electronics\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{shipmentUrl}}/shipment",
              "host": ["{{shipmentUrl}}"],
              "path": ["shipment"]
            },
            "description": "Create shipment via the standalone `l1-shipment-service`.\n\n**Token validation flow:**\n1. JWT signature + expiry — **validated locally** (RS256 public key)\n2. Required scope (`shipment:create`) — **checked from JWT claims**\n3. Revocation — calls `L2 /internal/auth/check-revocation`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "L2 Internal (Direct Access)",
      "description": "Direct access to L2 internal endpoints. Useful for debugging and manual testing.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Issue Token (Direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
            "raw": "{\n    \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\"\n}"
          },
          "url": {
            "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/auth/token",
            "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
            "path": ["internal", "auth", "token"]
          },
          "description": "Direct token issuance from L2 (bypasses L1 proxy)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Token Revocation",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/auth/check-revocation?jti=REPLACE_WITH_JTI",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "auth", "check-revocation"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "jti", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_JTI" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Check if a specific JTI (JWT ID) has been revoked.\n\nExtract the `jti` from the JWT payload (the `jti` claim)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/health",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Basic health check for L2."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin (Direct L2)",
      "description": "Direct admin access to L2 internal admin endpoints. Bypasses L1 proxy.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Clients (Direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/admin/clients",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "clients"]
            },
            "description": "List all registered clients directly via L2."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Scope (Direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"scopeName\": \"custom:scope\",\n    \"description\": \"A custom scope\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/admin/scopes",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "scopes"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new scope directly via L2."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Error Scenarios",
      "description": "Test cases for error handling.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Missing Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Call a protected endpoint without any Authorization header.\n\n**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer invalid.jwt.here" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Call a protected endpoint with a malformed JWT.\n\n**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized (`AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID`)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Wrong Client Credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"wrong-secret\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
